1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:02,790
Syaitan boleh masuk dalam jasad

2
00:00:02,790 --> 00:00:05,960
manusia banyak cara, bukan hanya

3
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:07,280
dengan mulut.

4
00:00:07,280 --> 00:00:10,240
Dia boleh masuk ikut laluan mana

5
00:00:10,240 --> 00:00:11,240
yang nak masuk.

6
00:00:11,240 --> 00:00:13,580
Penghalangnya ialah zikrullah.

7
00:00:13,580 --> 00:00:17,320
Macam kita makanlah, kenapa suruh

8
00:00:17,320 --> 00:00:18,600
baca basmalah, bismillah?

9
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:20,910
Sebab kalau tak baca basmalah, makan

10
00:00:20,910 --> 00:00:21,600
dengan syaitan.

11
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:25,650
Kita mandi, masuk bilik air, dia

12
00:00:25,650 --> 00:00:27,700
suruh baca basmalah, kenapa?

13
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:30,290
Nabi kata itu menutup antara kamu

14
00:00:30,290 --> 00:00:31,760
dengan syaitan.

15
00:00:31,760 --> 00:00:32,960
Mandi,

16
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:34,510
telanjang.

17
00:00:36,920 --> 00:00:40,140
Tapi baca basmalah ini salah satu

18
00:00:40,140 --> 00:00:42,360
cara untuk menghalang daripada

19
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:43,450
penglihatan syaitan.

20
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:44,360
Kita tak nampak syaitan.

21
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:48,120
Innahu yarakum huwa wa qabiluhu min

22
00:00:48,120 --> 00:00:49,800
haithu la taraunahum.

23
00:00:50,690 --> 00:00:52,320
Dia tengok

24
00:00:54,470 --> 00:00:55,670
kamu.

25
00:00:55,720 --> 00:00:59,740
Innahu yarakum, dia tengok kamu.

26
00:00:59,740 --> 00:01:02,160
Min haithu la taraunahum.

27
00:01:02,160 --> 00:01:06,750
Innahu yarakum huwa wa qabiluhu, dia

28
00:01:06,750 --> 00:01:08,675
tengok kamu, bukan dia, dia, wa

29
00:01:08,675 --> 00:01:11,380
qabiluhu, dan qabilah dia, min

30
00:01:11,380 --> 00:01:13,919
haithu la taraunahum,

31
00:01:14,560 --> 00:01:17,520
dari sudut mana kamu tak tengok mereka.

32
00:01:17,520 --> 00:01:21,560
Kita tak nampak ni, jin-jin keliling

33
00:01:21,560 --> 00:01:23,680
kita tak nampak, dia nampak kita.

34
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:25,450
Sudut mana nampak belakang, kita tak

35
00:01:25,450 --> 00:01:25,960
nampak dia.

36
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:29,540
Yang menutup ialah basmalah, itu

37
00:01:29,540 --> 00:01:31,920
hadis berkaitan dengan masuk bilik air.
